_assets/steam/apps/845030/extras/4b70ce600ac7aa042ce971ef89a4575f.webm?t=1741787207\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/845030/extras/4b70ce600ac7aa042ce971ef89a4575f.mp4?t=1741787207\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/845030/extras/35ff0a4a48453391a6de2158231d33be.avif?t=1741787207\" width=444 height=112 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your Soulflame to smash through the mysterious crystals scattered throughout each memory. Unleash their power to soar to new heights, reach the unreachable and safely navigate perilous environments. Hit multiple crystals at once to combined their energies and find new creative ways to reach the end gate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/845030/extras/c8eb5eb98ad53155a5360510448e01fc.poster.avif?t=1741787207\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/845030/extras/c8eb5eb98ad53155a5360510448e01fc.webm?t=1741787207\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/845030/extras/c8eb5eb98ad53155a5360510448e01fc.mp4?t=1741787207\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/845030/extras/874b59426ec8cf058fcb85f1a750a4c3.avif?t=1741787207\" width=444 height=130 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rise to the challenge and collect &quot;Essences&quot; by reaching all the areas within each memory. Use them to unlock ancient artefacts and boost Ki's attribu